   "text": "Musk wants data centers in orbit. Physics reviewed the proposal. Verdict: cute.\n\nThe bottleneck was never compute. It's heat — a data center is mostly a machine for getting rid of it, and Earth does that for free: rivers, night air, winter. Orbit offers vacuum, the same https://t.co/nNG8XFAI7O",
